&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:3pt;padding-right:3pt;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:11pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;Lantrovision(S)Ltdが&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;YL Integrated Pte Ltdの株式を取得し&lt;/span&gt;連結子会社化&lt;/p&gt;
